{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"484626","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/484626","key":"MC-297491","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"04/May/25 9:51 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<div class=\"panel\" style=\"background-color: #eae6ff;border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\" style=\"background-color: #eae6ff;\">\n<p>This behavior was introduced in <b>25w09a</b>.</p>\n</div></div>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n\n<p>When loading a font from a <tt>ttf</tt> file in a resource pack, the text isn't rendered correctly on glowing signs. The shape of the characters is correct, but the highlighting doesn't correctly appear behind the text, instead overlapping with it. Only the characters that are changed by the <tt>ttf</tt> file are affected.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Stepstoreproduce\"></a>Steps to reproduce</h3>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Load the <span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/501527\" title=\"font_from_ttf.zip attached to MC-297491\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"font_from_ttf.zip\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"91240643-590d-457b-b2bf-a44fd344a0f9\" rel=\"noreferrer\">font_from_ttf.zip<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span> resource pack (or any resource pack that uses a <tt>ttf</tt> font).</li>\n\t<li>Paste the text from <span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/501528\" title=\"sign_text.txt attached to MC-297491\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"sign_text.txt\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"b3ce7bd5-8e97-4cd7-8ac3-088ac46a449a\" rel=\"noreferrer\">sign_text.txt<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span> (or any character changed by a resource pack using a <tt>ttf</tt> font) into a sign.</li>\n\t<li>Use a glow ink sac on the sign.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Observedbehavior\"></a>Observed behavior</h3>\n\n<p>The text will exhibit an effect that looks like z-fighting (as seen in the video below, where the <span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/501527\" title=\"font_from_ttf.zip attached to MC-297491\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"font_from_ttf.zip\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"91240643-590d-457b-b2bf-a44fd344a0f9\" rel=\"noreferrer\">font_from_ttf.zip<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span> resource pack is used).</p>\n\n<p></p><div class=\"embeddedObject\"><object classid=\"clsid:02BF25D5-8C17-4B23-BC80-D3488ABDDC6B\" codebase=\"https://www.apple.com/qtactivex/qtplugin.cab\" data=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/501530?stream=true\" height=\"380\" type=\"video/mp4\" width=\"480\"><param name=\"data\" value=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/501530?stream=true\"><param name=\"src\" value=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/501530?stream=true\"><param name=\"type\" value=\"video/mp4\"><embed height=\"380\" pluginspage=\"https://www.apple.com/quicktime/download/\" src=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/501530?stream=true\" type=\"video/mp4\" width=\"480\"></object></div><p></p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedbehavior\"></a>Expected behavior</h3>\n\n<p>The glowing effect would be rendered behind the text, as was the case prior to 25w09a, and as still happens when a font is loaded from a <tt>png</tt> file (as seen in the video below, where the <span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/501526\" title=\"font_from_png.zip attached to MC-297491\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"font_from_png.zip\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"7e5a5476-1d91-40ba-87fe-0b409270bed1\" rel=\"noreferrer\">font_from_png.zip<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span> resource pack is used).</p>\n\n<p></p><div class=\"embeddedObject\"><object classid=\"clsid:02BF25D5-8C17-4B23-BC80-D3488ABDDC6B\" codebase=\"https://www.apple.com/qtactivex/qtplugin.cab\" data=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/501529?stream=true\" height=\"380\" type=\"video/mp4\" width=\"480\"><param name=\"data\" value=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/501529?stream=true\"><param name=\"src\" value=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/501529?stream=true\"><param name=\"type\" value=\"video/mp4\"><embed height=\"380\" pluginspage=\"https://www.apple.com/quicktime/download/\" src=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/501529?stream=true\" type=\"video/mp4\" width=\"480\"></object></div><p></p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":null,"customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/512338","id":"512338","filename":"2025-06-20_16.44.23.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"Andrew Burton","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"customer"},"created":"21/Jun/25 4:02 PM","size":"181 kB","mimeTyp